=== Scenario A: real ECONNREFUSED on loopback, then recovery ===
attempt 1 @ +0ms: GET http://127.0.0.1:44421/
attempt 1 threw real fault -> TypeError: fetch failed | cause: Error code=ECONNREFUSED
withDaytonaRetry gave up after 1 attempt(s): TypeError: fetch failed | cause: Error code=ECONNREFUSED
attempts=1 outcome=undefined
