attempt 1 threw real fault -> TypeError: fetch failed | cause: SocketError code=UND_ERR_SOCKET
withDaytonaRetry gave up after 1 attempt(s): TypeError: fetch failed | cause: SocketError code=UND_ERR_SOCKET
attempts=1 outcome=undefined
